Bus factor, as the smallest number of authors holding 50% of the surviving lines in the whole repo, is 2: Troy Goode (both addresses) and Douglas Christopher Wilson together hold 72.5%. Reaching 80% takes 4 authors. Counting the reformat commit, the bus factor is still 2, but those two hold 58.9%.

Lines are counted at HEAD for the whole repo, not only for the window's commits. They say nothing about quality, review work or deleted code.

